sers/ajreckof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-08T16:29:13Z","updated_at":"2026-08-08T16:31:13Z","body":"> > Once saved there seems to have two other options added which are \"Open in Editor\" and \"Show in FileSystem\". Is there any specific reason why this PR adds clear inheritance but not the two others?\r\n> \r\n> Because there is no file to open in the editor/ FileSystem until the new scene is saved as a file?\r\n> \r\n> Clear inheritance does not require a file, so it can work before the new scene is saved as a file.\r\n\r\nI think you misunderstand what those two options do. They are a way to open and show the packed scene that was instancited/inherited. \"Open In Editor\" would do the same as the button on the right. This is possible even before saving the current scene as the one needing to be saved is the on the current inherits from.\r\n\r\nFor clarity this is the button I'm talking about \r\n<img width=\"235\" height=\"92\" alt=\"Capture d’écran 2026-08-08 à 18 30 18\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/32074a00-9d1c-41b3-840d-c2e39021f232\" />\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5227004819/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5227119652","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119638#issuecomment-5227119652","issue_url":"https://api.github.com